sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Analyst UI
  participant BE as FastAPI
  participant ML as waf-ml
  participant DB as waf_pending_rules
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant A as Admin
  participant RM as rule_manager
  participant N as waf-nginx
  participant E as Edges
  U->>BE: POST /api/ml/predict-and-suggest
  BE->>ML: /predict แล้ว /generate-rule
  BE->>DB: create_pending_rule (status=pending)
  UI->>DB: GET /api/ml-rules
  A->>UI: ตรวจรายละเอียด / blast radius
  A->>UI: Approve
  UI->>RM: POST /api/ml-rules/{id}/approve
  RM->>RM: write_ml_rule(ml-<id>.conf)
  RM->>N: nginx -t แล้ว reload (ล้มเหลว = ลบไฟล์)
  RM->>DB: status=approved, deployed_rule_id
  E->>E: ดึง bundle จาก control-api ทุก 5s
